## 3. Extensions (post Full V1)

Only these remain outside Full Production V1. Each has a product/technical rationale — not deferred for convenience alone.

| Extension | Rationale |
| --------- | --------- |
| WhatsApp / omnichannel (Telegram, etc.) | Requires channel adapters, webhook ingress, identity linking, and compliance review per region; out of band with PCMS portal authority |
| AI auto-reply / triage | Needs model governance, PII redaction pipeline, and human-in-the-loop; separate from core ticket integrity |
| Standalone knowledge base / public forum | Different content lifecycle and SEO surface; links from tickets sufficient in V1 |
| Public ticketing marketplace | No product evidence; cross-tenant leakage risk |
| Cross-tenant platform administration inbox | Violates tenant isolation charter; platform admin remains audit-only |
| Ticket watchers / CC participants (`TicketParticipant`) | Useful but not required for club support V1; assignee + requester sufficient |
| Auto-close timer (Zendesk 4-day solved→closed) | Policy variant; V1 uses manual close + SLA breach escalation |
| Custom per-tenant status buckets (Zendesk custom statuses API) | Fixed enum + labels keeps core transitions testable; workspace labels on categories instead |

---

## 4. Personas

| Persona | Role | App | Full V1 capabilities |
| ------- | ---- | --- | -------------------- |
| Club member | `member` | Portal | Create, list own, read own, public reply, attachments on own ticket, reopen `resolved`, link tour/registration — **member = own-ticket access** |
| Club viewer | `viewer` | Portal | List tenant tickets, read any member ticket (public + internal read-only), notifications read — **viewer = tenant-wide read-only**; **viewer mutations = denied** |
| Club operator | `admin` | Web | Full inbox, queues, assign (user/team), reply, internal note, bulk actions, templates, reports read |
| Workspace owner | `owner` | Web | Same as admin + workspace settings, SLA policies, archive/delete |
| Platform admin | — | — | **Extension** — no cross-tenant ticket access |

