## 10. API contract (Full V1)

### 10.1 Conventions

- Member upstream: `/member/tickets/*`
- Operator upstream: `/tickets/*`, `/ticket-queues/*`, `/ticket-teams/*`, `/ticket-categories/*`, `/ticket-tags/*`, `/ticket-templates/*`, `/ticket-sla-policies/*`, `/ticket-reports/*`
- Portal BFF: `/api/me/tickets/*`, `/api/me/ticket-notifications/*`
- Auth: JWT (member/viewer) or `requireOperatorSession` + operator surfaces
- Pagination: cursor + `limit` (default 20, max 50 list / 100 search)
- Mutations: `Idempotency-Key` header required
- Updates: `rowVersion` required on PATCH
- Errors: §10.4

### 10.2 Member API

| Method | Path | Auth | Notes |
| ------ | ---- | ---- | ----- |
| GET | `/member/tickets` | member \| viewer | member: own; viewer: tenant |
| POST | `/member/tickets` | member | create + first message |
| GET | `/member/tickets/:id` | member \| viewer | messages per visibility rules |
| POST | `/member/tickets/:id/messages` | member | public reply |
| POST | `/member/tickets/:id/reopen` | member | from `resolved` |
| POST | `/member/tickets/:id/attachments` | member | pre-signed upload flow |
| GET | `/member/ticket-notifications` | member \| viewer | durable inbox |
| PATCH | `/member/ticket-notifications/:id/read` | member \| viewer | mark read |

### 10.3 Operator API

| Method | Path | Surface | Notes |
| ------ | ---- | ------- | ----- |
| GET | `/tickets` | read | search, filter, sort, cursor |
| POST | `/tickets/bulk` | bulk | assign, status, priority, tags |
| GET/PATCH | `/tickets/:id` | read/mutate | detail + rowVersion |
| POST | `/tickets/:id/replies` | mutate | public |
| POST | `/tickets/:id/internal-notes` | mutate | internal |
| POST | `/tickets/:id/attachments` | mutate | operator upload |
| CRUD | `/ticket-queues/*` | settings | queue definitions |
| CRUD | `/ticket-teams/*` | settings | teams |
| CRUD | `/ticket-categories/*` | settings | categories |
| CRUD | `/ticket-tags/*` | settings | tags |
| CRUD | `/ticket-templates/*` | settings | canned responses |
| CRUD | `/ticket-sla-policies/*` | settings | SLA |
| GET | `/ticket-reports/summary` | reports | volumes, SLA, backlog |

### 10.4 Error codes

| Code | HTTP | When |
| ---- | ---- | ---- |
| `TICKET_NOT_FOUND` | 404 | Missing or wrong tenant |
| `TICKET_CLOSED` | 409 | Reply on closed |
| `TICKET_ON_HOLD` | 409 | Member reply while on hold |
| `TICKET_VIEWER_READ_ONLY` | 403 | **viewer mutations = denied** |
| `TICKET_VERSION_CONFLICT` | 409 | rowVersion mismatch |
| `TICKET_INVALID_TRANSITION` | 409 | Status matrix |
| `TICKET_ASSIGNEE_INVALID` | 400 | User/team not in tenant |
| `TICKET_CATEGORY_INVALID` | 400 | Unknown/disabled category |
| `TICKET_SLA_BREACH` | — | event only, not client error |
| `TICKET_ATTACHMENT_REJECTED` | 400 | scan failed |
| `TICKET_MODULE_DISABLED` | 404 | manifest flag off |
| `TICKET_STORAGE_UNAVAILABLE` | 503 | memory driver |

