| D1 | Manifest key `workspaceTicketing` | **DECISION** |
| D2 | Viewer scope | **DECISION:** tenant-wide read-only |
| D3 | Status literals | **DECISION:** four core + onHold flag |
| D4 | Queue as saved filter | **DECISION:** yes (JSM-aligned) |
| D5 | Platform admin inbox | **Extension** |
| D6 | Urban default enablement | Product per club |

