## 19. Category and priority (summary)

**Category:** `TicketCategory` per tenant/workspace; manifest seeds defaults.

**Priority:** member cannot set; operator triages. Values: `low`, `normal`, `high`, `urgent`.

---

## 20. Readiness

**Verdict:** Full Production V1 design complete. Implementation follows §22 phased roadmap.

**Recommended verdict:** `READY_FOR_PHASED_IMPLEMENTATION`

