| Messaging | `addPublicMessage`, `addInternalNote` | message routes | composers | `ticket.message.created` | core + E2E | Phase C | flag off |
| Lifecycle | transition matrix | PATCH status | status dropdown | `ticket.status.changed` | lifecycle.spec | Phase C | flag off |
| Categories | `TicketCategory` | CRUD settings | settings tab | — | API + validation | Phase D | disable category |
| Tags | tag assignment | tag routes | filter chips | — | API | Phase D | — |
| Queues | `TicketQueue` | queue routes | inbox sidebar | — | API | Phase D/G | — |
| Teams/assign | assign user/team | assign + bulk | dropdowns | `ticket.assigned` | permissions | Phase D | — |
| Viewer | permissions | member routes | read-only UI | — | permissions.spec | Phase F | — |
| Attachments | `TicketAttachment` | upload/download | attach button | — | storage spec | Phase E | disable upload |
| Business links | FK validation | create/detail | sidebar cards | — | integration | Phase E | — |
| Audit | `TicketEvent` | detail | timeline | audit pipeline | API | Phase C | — |
| Notifications | `TicketNotification` | inbox routes | bell + list | outbox | integration | Phase H | disable channel |
| Email/SMS | port adapter | webhook config | settings | outbox | contract tests | Phase H | disable provider |
| SLA | policy + state | SLA routes | badges + reports | breach events | SLA spec | Phase I | disable SLA |
| Templates | `TicketTemplate` | template routes | composer picker | — | API | Phase J | — |
| Search/filter | query parsers | GET list params | inbox filters | — | API | Phase G | — |
| Bulk | batch commands | POST bulk | toolbar | per-ticket events | API | Phase G | — |
| Reports | aggregates | report routes | dashboard | — | API | Phase K | hide nav |
| Settings | manifest + DB | settings routes | settings UI | — | E2E | Phase K | — |
| a11y/RTL | — | — | all surfaces | — | axe + manual | Phase L | — |

